ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aySDgt6fNvsQ7kNvwFwig9i&_nc_oc=Adr5_GujCnObuysEzyeBlf412N4D_-1FZ6WTCrL0fVJt_A6j1HC-RTuudmOs7iIkGcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwe9ihKcLxemoi_NK8S0hFieH9u0l-gSRQ5p8aNyKMKOg&oe=69C12181"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hv1645mLQlEQ7kNvwHyFYrT&_nc_oc=AdrJ8-VBfmAqyTsbDMC3-Cn90LOXaWLLo--mbpA9fn3k6dDbfqKLfO9qcAJNVlReYRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfznayUm0qYTTQVnPpYXiBJaOcH_BbT9P5-uaQ1ROWSlsw&oe=69C12EE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GxnRlqk7bG0Q7kNvwGijxA3&_nc_oc=AdrWZRCB0jJ7GK_NwIUGhHn4DnPrMjXTDtAbEJHUuYrZY0PeWVL2-qbL57Vvc3iPLrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss